// The TPM will validate that the authPolicy is either the size of the digest
// produced by nameAlg or the Empty Buffer.
//
// If nameAlg is TPM_ALG_NULL, then the Name is the Empty Buffer. When the
// authorization value for an object with no Name is computed, no Name value is
// included in the HMAC. To ensure that these unnamed entities are not
// substituted, it is recommended that they have an authValue that is
// statistically unique.
//
// The digest size for TPM_ALG_NULL is zero.
TpmTestVector(
  name: "[TPM2_LoadExternal] authPolicy checks",
  spec_versions: [
    184,
  ],
  test_sequence: [
  ]
)
